    "text": "Her cy\u00fe on \u00feysum gewrite hu Wynfl\u00e6d gel\u00e6dde hyre gewitnesse \u00e6t Wulfamere beforan \u00e6\u00feelrede\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00feonne Sigeric arcebiscop & Ordbyrht biscop & \u00e6lfric ealderman & \u00e6lf\u00fery\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges\n\u00dea sende se cyning \u00fe\u00e6r rihte be \u00feam arcebiscope & be \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r mid him to gewitnesse w\u00e6ron to\n\u00dea dyde man swa.\n\u00dea sende se cyning be \u00e6luere abbude his insegel to \u00feam gemote \u00e6t Cwicelmeshl\u00e6we & grette ealle \u00fea\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00e6\u00feelsige biscop & \u00e6scwig biscop & \u00e6lfric abbud & eal sio scir & b\u00e6d & het \u00fe\u00e6t hi scioldon\n& Sigeric arcebiscop sende his swutelunga \u00fe\u00e6rto & Ordbyrht biscop his.\n\u00dea get\u00e6hte man Wynfl\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hio moste hit hyre geahnian.\n\u00dea gel\u00e6dde hio \u00fea ahnunga mid \u00e6lf\u00fery\u00fee fultume \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges modor.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest Wulfgar abbud & Wulfstan priost & \u00e6fic \u00feara \u00e6\u00feelinga discsten & Eadwine &\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea witan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t betere w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00feene a\u00fe aweg lete \u00feonne hine man sealde\n\u00dea let he \u00feone a\u00fe aweg & sealde \u00e6\u00feelsige biscope unbesacen land on hand \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feanon for\u00f0 sy\u00fe\u00fean\n\u00dea t\u00e6hte man hyre \u00fe\u00e6t hio sciolde bringan his f\u00e6der gold & siolfor eal \u00fe\u00e6t hio h\u00e6fde.\n\u00dea dyde hio swa hio dorste hyre a\u00fee gebiorgan.\n\u00dea n\u00e6s he \u00feagyt on \u00feam gehealden butan hio sceolde swerian \u00fe\u00e6t his \u00e6hta \u00fe\u00e6r ealle w\u00e6ron.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe hio \u00fe\u00e6t hio ne mihte hyre d\u00e6les ne he his.\n& \u00feyses w\u00e6s \u00e6lfgar \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges gerefa to gewitnesse & Byrhtric & Leofric \u00e6t Hwitecyrcan & menig",
